    <string name="about_android">This is the Android build: the phone reads heart rate from a BLE watch and forwards it to VRChat over OSC on the local network. VRChat listens on UDP 9000 on all interfaces, so the phone can connect directly; allow UDP 9000 in Windows Firewall if it is blocked.</string>
